  "author": "theabhinavgaur",
  "severity": "MEDIUM",
  "description": "Adobe Experience Manager contains a cross-site scripting vulnerability via requests using the childlist selector when a dispatcher does not respect the content type responded by AEM and flips from application/json to text/html. As a consequence, the reflected suffix is executed and interpreted in the browser.\n",
